select2.min.js and select2.min.css are vendored, unmodified copies of
Select2, used for the group picker on the platform-forwarding and MCP
admin pages.

  Project: Select2 (https://select2.org)
  Version: 4.0.13
  Source:  https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/select2@4.0.13/dist/
  License: MIT

The banner in select2.min.js links to LICENSE.md in the upstream
repository rather than reproducing the terms; MIT requires the notice to
accompany the copy, so it is reproduced here. select2.min.css carries no
banner at all and is covered by this file too.

